*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.backup
.env.production
.env.local
# Every other environment file too (.env.testing, .env.staging, ...): real
# keys and passwords were once committed in documentation files. Only the
# template with empty values belongs in git.
.env.*
.phpactor.json
.phpunit.result.cache
/.fleet
/.idea
/.nova
/.phpunit.cache
/.vscode
/.zed
/auth.json
/node_modules
# public/build is deliberately NOT ignored. The Hostinger plan has no Node, so
# the compiled assets have to travel through the repo — without them the server
# serves a stale manifest and none of the frontend changes appear.
# Run `npm run build` and commit the result whenever frontend code changes.
/public/hot
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/storage/backups
/vendor
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db

# Staff e-signatures uploaded through the app (User Management / My Profile) live on the host, not in git.
/public/images/E-signitures/uploads

# Local AI-assistant and editor folders: settings and notes for this machine, not the app.
/.claude
/.kiro
